<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select rib and round cuts weak, while chuck and loin cuts steady to weak. Choice round and loin cuts firm, while rib cuts weak and chuck cuts generally steady. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>302 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 12 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>36 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     96.14	 95.40	 92.61	 91.49</p>
<p>		  -0.09	 -0.04	 -0.17	 -0.37</p>
</text>
